{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281200","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028120001:1":{"text":"아까는 정말 위험했지만, 여러분 덕분이에요...","source_cn":"刚才很危险，多亏有你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC541C8057FB630A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028120002:1":{"text":"흩어진 마력을 전부 흡수 할테니 마지막 기억을 봐주세요...","source_cn":"让我把逸散的魔力完全吸收，看完最后的回忆吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE457F056E914DA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1028120002":{"text":"흩어진 마력을 전부 흡수 할테니 마지막 기억을 봐주세요...","source_cn":"让我把逸散的魔力完全吸收，看完最后的回忆吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE457F056E914DA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028120003:0":{"text":"휴윈, 나갈지 말지 아직 결정 못한 거야? 음... 나였어도 꽤 망설였을 거야...","source_cn":"伊温，你没想好要不要出去吗？嗯……这个问题要是问我的话...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3E69E5E4A8354BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028120004:0":{"text":"프라벨, 난... 난 영원히 이곳에 머물고 싶어. 여기서 타란 강이 키운 모든 생명들을 도와주고 싶어.","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，我……我想永远留在这里，帮助所有塔兰河抚育的生灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F032159DC874AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028120005:0":{"text":"나 참 못났다... 그치?","source_cn":"我是不是……很没出息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39242CA83D189A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028120006:0":{"text":"그런 말이 어딨어? 네 힘은 어디에서든 따스한 빗방울이 될 거야.","source_cn":"怎么会呢？无论在哪里，你的力量都会化成温柔的雨滴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E0EF71E6333EB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028120007:0":{"text":"그 비가 연인의 소원에 내리면 꽃들을 키워낼 거고, 물속에 떨어지면 타란 강과 함께 저 먼 곳까지 흘러갈 거야...","source_cn":"落在情人之愿，就能滋润这里的花草；落在水中，就会随着塔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF63133A9C7CD9CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028120008:0":{"text":"휴윈, 정말 멋져! 네가 가장 원하는 게 뭔지 아는 것도 하나의 용기인 걸!","source_cn":"伊温，这样很好呀！你知道自己最想要的是什么，这也是一种勇气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD92E9BAC01D26864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028120009:0":{"text":"내가... 용기를?","source_cn":"我……勇气？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E40B20D0F415817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028120010:0":{"text":"당연하지! 낯설고 위험한 상황에서 대담하게 앞으로 나아가는 것도 용기지만, 자신의 내면을 직시하고 자신의 길을 선택하는 것도 대단한 선택이야!","source_cn":"当然了！面对陌生和危险，大胆向前，这是勇气；但直面内心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4593EBA8AC6FCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028120011:0":{"text":"휴윈, 넌 생각보다 용감한 사람이야.","source_cn":"伊温，你比你想象中更加勇敢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC194B998D95CB88D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028120012:0":{"text":"프라벨, 고마워...","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF53D6E827C0761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028120013:0":{"text":"이게 바로... 휴윈 양의 실제 기억이군요.","source_cn":"原来……这才是伊温小姐真正的回忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14F3722BD3EB402D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028120014:1":{"text":"여러 가지 칭찬을 들어봤지만, 누군가 제게 “용감하다”고 말해준 건 그게 처음이었어요.","source_cn":"我听过许多不同的赞美，可那是第一次有人说我“有勇气”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x787051403D7C9D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028120015:0":{"text":"프라벨 덕분에 깨달았죠. 용기란 외부의 위험에 과감히 도전하는 것뿐만 아니라 자신의 마음을 따르는 것 또한 용기라는 걸...","source_cn":"从芙拉贝尔那里我才知道，勇气不光是敢于挑战外界的危险，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600FBD19BB69F15C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028120016:0":{"text":"죄송해요... 자꾸만 추억에 잠기네요. 잠시만요, 곧 이곳의 마력을 다 회수할 수 있어요.","source_cn":"抱歉……我总是忍不住沉浸在回忆中。请稍等，我马上就能将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB54E1BCFB1C7D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"(기억의 조각을 다시 한 번 활성화 시킨다)","source_cn":"再次激活记忆碎片","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B5F4FC5E18C6BA0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(기억의 조각을 다시 한 번 활성화 시킨다)","female":"(기억의 조각을 다시 한 번 활성화 시킨다)","variant_male_record_index":"61206","variant_female_record_index":"61207","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:回忆中的芙拉贝尔":{"text":"프라벨","source":"回忆中的芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:回忆中的伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"回忆中的伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":4}}